                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "526126f9-2a05-4370-bc24-bff92190c056",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a8c7dd2-2982-3f6c-9dc0-ecb3900834a2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1d6b0a63-24aa-3c2d-af78-38e3142b4838",
                        "target_lang_word": "aghast",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aghast",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                        "entry_id": "85144750-6011-3507-859d-58526cc2d687",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Terrified; struck with amazement; showing signs of terror or horror."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df126f35-30b1-48e5-8a61-ecbb98ff5591",
                                                "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                                "text": "I was aghast when the incident unfolded in front of me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a3a698b-4e2a-4a56-a9cd-f4274312ea32",
                                                "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                                "text": "Betraide by fortune and ſuſpitious loue,\nThreatned with frowning wrath and iealouſie,\nSurpriz’d with feare and hideous reuenge,\nI ſtand agaſt: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7a1e755-4737-45bf-b808-89805b36f014",
                                                "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                                "text": "And while the revellers stood aghast at the fury of the man, one more wicked or, it may be, more drunken than the rest, cried out that they should put the hounds upon her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "816860f9-8a9c-4ec5-90ef-1a31a0ffc793",
                                                "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                                "text": "1985, Les Misérables, the song \"Red and Black\"\nI am agog! I am aghast! Is Marius in love at last?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e33865b-1af8-4941-a8e3-d26deb58b745",
                                                "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                                "text": "We sat at a long table with a huge salmon on a platter in the center, prepared Szechuan style. Dad sat at one end of the table, and regaled all present with his stories. In the middle of one convoluted yarn, he rose and went around to the salmon in the center of the table. Using his fingers, he dug an eyeball out of the fish, popped it in his mouth and swallowed it whole as we looked on, aghast. “A real delicacy,” he said, with a boyish smirk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0762848-c096-4974-8285-eff2fcfe0719",
                                                "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                                "text": "Hart, for one, will not remember the night for Lambert's heroics. Morrison, not closed down quickly enough, struck his shot well but England's No1 will be aghast at the way it struck his gloves then skidded off his knees and into the net."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0276f0b-c97b-4849-8b8e-cfc2ae8a4de5",
                                                "sense_id": "eb335b30-54db-358e-8032-68485d5f79e3",
                                                "text": "For months, Democrats have watched aghast as President Donald Trump has unleashed his head-spinning, all-of-government brand of disruption."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "23fed8cd-5b1c-479d-a0f6-0c3a367ef352",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a8c7dd2-2982-3f6c-9dc0-ecb3900834a2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1d6b0a63-24aa-3c2d-af78-38e3142b4838",
                        "target_lang_word": "perplexed",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "perplexed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57f5e0bc-9996-3728-8f7d-68235e111190",
                                        "entry_id": "ddd9e923-fa44-35f8-bd71-14b3c9462239",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Confused or puzzled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ae04f71-52df-4ccf-8334-d235feaa3bc0",
                                                "sense_id": "57f5e0bc-9996-3728-8f7d-68235e111190",
                                                "text": "The scientists were perplexed by the new discovery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc69e000-e651-485b-b072-e13eddf9b4d8",
                                                "sense_id": "57f5e0bc-9996-3728-8f7d-68235e111190",
                                                "text": "She was perplexed. 'Plege'illegience is plege'illegience!'\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87761e67-a84e-4a25-9b16-8d8dbd37a79c",
                                                "sense_id": "57f5e0bc-9996-3728-8f7d-68235e111190",
                                                "text": "Perplexed, Wheeler continues to play for a moment or two, keeping to his own internal time. But after another moment it becomes clear that something is wrong, something which everybody can see but him. He steals a glance up from his instrument, and finds that Luján is staring at him. In fact, every musician in the orchestra is staring at him, all of them wearing the same expression of stony, barely-contained ang—\nThey've been replaced."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a3b6b06-f18b-32b5-9a11-4ffb7b75c7bb",
                                        "entry_id": "ddd9e923-fa44-35f8-bd71-14b3c9462239",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bewildered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58655f04-c864-3460-861a-68116cd9f840",
                                        "entry_id": "ddd9e923-fa44-35f8-bd71-14b3c9462239",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Entangled; labyrinthine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a727c073-17d4-4a04-be38-3a80706b9bbb",
                                                "sense_id": "58655f04-c864-3460-861a-68116cd9f840",
                                                "text": "\"[…] But come, Lady, we are too near the mouth of the cavern; let us seek its inmost recesses. […]\" \"Though all your actions are noble, […] is it fitting that I should accompany you alone into these perplexed retreats? Should we be found together, what would a censorious world think of my conduct?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "perplexed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5a164ce-19b3-38ad-8605-48236244d9c6",
